  'home.story.quote': { en: 'When my son was born at 28 weeks, I was terrified. Voice of Preemies gave me a community, knowledge, and the strength to fight for him every single day.', fr: 'Quand mon fils est né à 28 semaines, j\'étais terrifiée. Voice of Preemies m\'a donné une communauté, des connaissances et la force de me battre pour lui chaque jour.', kw: 'Igihe umuhungu wanjye avutse mu ndwi 28, naratumiwe ubwoba. Voice of Preemies yampaye umuryango, ubumenyi, n\'imbaraga zo kurwanira buri munsi.' },
